:{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2JHUGSATXT5VR","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JHUGSATXT5VR"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.dcojkVP94AJ_oSMlR3hZJQ","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.dcojkVP94AJ_oSMlR3hZJQ"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/104711852?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"historical-fiction","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/104711852?shelf=historical-fiction"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8740479213"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.dzy4-0kMLNuQzSFOU7MnMQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.dzy4-0kMLNuQzSFOU7MnMQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:104711852"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1784339374818,"createdAt":1784137378136,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1784137409878,"text":"The Last Queen is one of the finest works of historical fiction I have read. C.W. Gortner brings Juana of Castile—known to history as Juana la Loca—to life with remarkable depth, transforming a legendary figure into a woman whose courage, intelligence, and heartbreaking struggles feel intensely real.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story is both sweeping and deeply personal, blending political intrigue, betrayal, ambition, and romance into a compelling narrative that never loses its emotional core. Juana’s journey from a young princess to a queen fighting for her birthright is unforgettable. Watching those closest to her manipulate and ultimately betray her was both heartbreaking and infuriating, making her story all the more powerful.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe historical detail is exceptional without ever becoming overwhelming. Instead, it enriches the story and immerses the reader in the royal courts of Spain and Flanders during a fascinating period of history. The audiobook is especially outstanding. The narrator delivers an emotional, nuanced performance that captures Juana’s strength, vulnerability, and determination, making an already remarkable novel even more memorable.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is historical fiction at its best—beautifully written, emotionally gripping, and impossible to forget. I highly recommend it to anyone who enjoys rich historical novels with compelling characters and true events brought vividly to life.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e5 Stars ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JHUGSATXT5VR\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.dcojkVP94AJ_oSMlR3hZJQ\"}}"},"likeCount":5,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:62673412":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":62673412,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1714859239i/62673412._UX200_CR0,8,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":490,"name":"Alexia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/62673412-alexia","contributor":null,"id":62673412},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3DR78G3HMO2B0":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3DR78G3HMO2B0"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3DR78G3HMO2B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3DR78G3HMO2B0","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3DR78G3HMO2B0"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"historical-fiction","displayName":"historical-fiction","editable":true,"default":false,"actionType":"add_to_custom_exclusive","sortOrder":4,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/62673412?shelf=historical-fiction"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6530942116"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xovchKcF0Sy0IvB6tsb1-A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xovchKcF0Sy0IvB6tsb1-A","creator":{"__ref":"User:62673412"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1717081153259,"createdAt":1717003846210,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1717036388609,"text":"I know from the very beginning what I was getting into when I started this book.I know Juana story but this book played so much with my feelings.\u003cbr /\u003eHer life was full of misfortune and despair.\u003cbr /\u003eHer marriage with Philip was an abusive one and her father,the one who was supposedly her savior betrayed her when she least expected.\u003cbr /\u003eAnd let's not talk about her son Charles V who treated her with such indifference that it still baffles me who you can do that to your own parent. \u003cbr /\u003eI believe that she was not mad and these were rumors spread by the man around her.\u003cbr /\u003eMaybe if she had not been surrounded on all sides by enemies she would have made a great queen.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3DR78G3HMO2B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg\"}}"},"likeCount":5,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AL4B0U64VTLUC\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AL4B0U64VTLUC","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AL4B0U64VTLUC"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1591888?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/34555741"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.esMo50SENsGOZ3bWhacdvA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.esMo50SENsGOZ3bWhacdvA","creator":{"__ref":"User:1591888"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1783999721057,"createdAt":1223189825000,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1224094310000,"text":"FROM PUBLISHERS WEEKLY:\u003cbr /\u003eThe 1492 conquest of Granada makes for high adventure and royal intrigue in this second sparkling historical from Gortner (The Secret Lion). Spanish Princess Juana, 13, watches as her parents, King Fernando and Queen Isabel, unite Spain, vanquish Moors and marry their children off to foreign kingdoms for favorable alliances: Princess Catalina becomes first wife to Henry VIII; Princess Juana, who narrates, is shipped off to marry Philip of Flanders, heir to the Hapsburg Empire. Although Juana balks at leaving Spain for the north and a husband she has never met, their instant chemistry soon turns to love. Years and children later, Juana unexpectedly becomes next in line to the Spanish crown and must carefully navigate every step of the journey from Flanders to Spain, fearful of alienating husband or parents or both. Emotional and political tensions soar as Juana's loyalties are tested to their limits. Disturbing royal secrets and court manipulations wickedly twist this enthralling story, brilliantly told. (July) \u003cbr /\u003eCopyright © Reed Business Information, a division of Reed Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved. \u003cbr /\u003e","rating":0,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AL4B0U64VTLUC\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg\"}}"},"likeCount":5,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1