mixed luck connecting with Gortner's historical interpretations. Liked this enough for re-read. Maybe.\u003cbr /\u003eJuana's mama has taken her to the remote castle where Juana's grandmother exists, imprisoned by Isabel long ago. Here be quotes:\u003cbr /\u003ep41 - \"Only my grandmother's head and upper torso were visible ... She looked so still, so insubstantial, I thought she must be dead. I forced myself to take a step closer. Something unheard, perhaps the brush of my fingers against the tester curtain or click of heel, awoke her. Eyes the hue of a frozen sea slowly opened, riveting me with their glassy stare. Her parched mouth moved, in a barely audible whisper: 'Eres mi alma.'\u003cbr /\u003e \"You are my soul. ...\u003cbr /\u003e \"Never had I beheld such unspeakable anguish. In my grandmother's eyes I saw the toll of an eternal night, of a solitude that had ravaged without succor or release. Forced to suffer isolation no mortal being should endure, she now begged with her eyes for mercy, a swift end to an existence that had ceased to hold any meaning.\u003cbr /\u003e...\u003cbr /\u003e\"'Why, Mama?' I asked. 'Why did you do this to her?'\" ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3HLC07J4EML4S\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.rampJ9NypA3J-JBXHnepCg\"}}"},"likeCount":5,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:84663688":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":84663688,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1532761641i/84663688._UX200_CR0,29,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":107,"textReviewsCount":731,"name":"Celestina1210","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/84663688-celestina1210","contributor":null,"id":84663688},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2KS76C784LHUQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2KS76C784LHUQ"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.BTF9